  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_bf23446d81314d1083ee2afba138eb2e",
      "statement": "The chat and embedding subsystems build on the cache subsystem: ChatModelProvider exposes its settings as a ChatCacheParameter and CachingChatModel/ChatModelUtils operate on Cache<ChatCacheKey>, while EmbeddingCreator.create(configuration, cacheManager) dispatches over the embedding platforms (now including BIFROST) to creators that receive a CacheManager and store embeddings into Cache<EmbeddingCacheKey>; the cache backends read connection settings from a util-layer EnvironmentProvider, and the util layer depends on no internal packages.",
