    {
      "id": "claim_e951ff2b09da422084a5d5b4c90d2b7d",
      "statement": "Model settings travel as the framework-neutral records LlmConfiguration (platform, modelName, seed, temperature, environment) and EmbeddingConfiguration (platform, modelName, optional ONNX model/tokenizer paths, environment); platform endpoints are read from the environment (OLLAMA_HOST, OPENWEBUI_URL) or hardcoded per platform in ChatModelProvider, so nothing in the library depends on an application-specific configuration object.",
