      "id": "claim_4cead8da1fcd421e981c3c424b499ae6",
      "statement": "The no-global-environment invariant is enforced by two ArchUnit rules in NoGlobalEnvironmentTest over all non-test classes of edu.kit.kastel.mcse.ardoco.llm: no static field may have a type assignable to EnvironmentProvider, and CacheManager.getDefaultInstance() may be called only from EmbeddingCreator.create(EmbeddingConfiguration) — everywhere else the cache manager, and with it the cache environment, must be injected.",
