    {
      "id": "claim_382c63df2245492d8375d998f505e39e",
      "statement": "Chat model creation is fail-fast but lazy: createChatModel() dispatches exhaustively over the six-platform ChatModelPlatform enum (OPENAI, OLLAMA, BLABLADOR, DEEPSEEK, OPENWEBUI, BIFROST) and reads the required platform credentials eagerly from the configuration's environment (missing variables throw IllegalStateException before any model object exists, for every platform), while each platform branch returns a LazyChatModel that constructs the real LangChain4j client on first use via thread-safe double-checked locking.",
