      "id": "claim_74734fb2e98f4b40b6a601e95f440710",
      "statement": "The LOCAL backend stores one self-contained JSON file per caller and model configuration named <Origin>_<model>_<seed>[_<temperature>].json (the temperature component is omitted when it is 0.0 for backward compatibility with LiSSA's existing caches), which makes a cache directory an offline replication package: layer LOCAL under REDIS/REST_REDIS while experimenting, flush at the end, ship the directory, and replicators re-run with CACHE_HIERARCHY=LOCAL without API keys or model access.",
