      "statement": "The library builds on Java 21 with the io.github.ardoco:parent 2.1.0 parent POM (artifact io.github.ardoco:llm-access, version 0.2.2-SNAPSHOT) and LangChain4j 1.23.0 imported as a BOM, using jtokkit 1.1.0 for token counting, org.fuchss:rest-redis 0.1.7 for the REST-Redis client, dotenv-java 3.2.0 for .env support, and Testcontainers (2.0.5 BOM, test scope) plus ArchUnit 1.5.1 for the architecture and cache-key-completeness tests; flatten-maven-plugin is pinned to 1.7.3 because the ardoco parent references it unversioned and 1.8.0 has an NPE regression in its CI-friendly interpolator, and central-publishing overrides deploymentName to ardoco-llm-access with autoPublish and waitUntil published.",
